    authors:
      - family-names: Nagy
        given-names: Corina
    title: >-
      Single-nucleus transcriptomics of the prefrontal cortex in major
      depressive disorder implicates oligodendrocyte precursor cells and
      excitatory neurons
    journal: Nature Neuroscience
    volume: 23
    start: 771
    end: 781
    year: 2020
    doi: 10.1038/s41593-020-0621-y
